  <entry>
    <title>Midscene 为什么要把 Locate 与 Action 拆成两步？</title>
    <link href="http://quanru.github.io/2026/05/26/Locate%20%E4%B8%8E%20Action%20%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%A6%81%E6%8B%86%E6%88%90%E4%B8%A4%E6%AD%A5/"/>
